msgstr "Skip Intro - How to use"

#: default.py
msgctxt "#32057"
msgid "1) Shortcuts\nCreate or edit userdata/keymaps/keyboard.xml and bind these two commands:\nRecord a marker: RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=record_skip_point)\nDelete a marker: RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=delete_skip_point)\n\n2) Recording rules\nWithin the first 20% of playback, the record key sets the intro end point.\nWithin the last 20%, it sets the credits length, counted back from the end, so episodes of different length still work.\n\n3) Season and per-episode markers\nThe first record of a season becomes the season marker. After that, recording a single episode only affects that episode.\nThe delete key only removes the current episode's marker; it never clears the season marker.\n\n4) Emby markers\nWith 'Use Emby markers' enabled, episodes already marked in Emby need no manual recording.\nPriority: per-episode marker > Emby marker > season marker."
msgstr "1) Shortcuts\nCreate or edit userdata/keymaps/keyboard.xml and bind these two commands:\nRecord a marker: RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=record_skip_point)\nDelete a marker: RunScript(plugin.video.skipintro, mode=delete_skip_point)\n\n2) Recording rules\nWithin the first 20% of playback, the record key sets the intro end point.\nWithin the last 20%, it sets the credits length, counted back from the end, so episodes of different length still work.\n\n3) Season and per-episode markers\nThe first record of a season becomes the season marker. After that, recording a single episode only affects that episode.\nThe delete key only removes the current episode's marker; it never clears the season marker.\n\n4) Emby markers\nWith 'Use Emby markers' enabled, episodes already marked in Emby need no manual recording.\nPriority: per-episode marker > Emby marker > season marker."

